would not move with the CUMULATIVE anchor date of metric "revenue_total"

# AVERAGE averages the metric's value: only a bare aggregate qualifies
statement error
CREATE SEMANTIC VIEW bad TABLES (dates PRIMARY KEY (day), events PRIMARY KEY (event_id)) RELATIONSHIPS (events (event_date) REFERENCES dates)
  DIMENSIONS (dates.day AS day) METRICS (events.x CUMULATIVE (dates.day AVERAGE) AS SQRT(SUM(amount)));
----
AVERAGE requires a metric computed from a single aggregate
